{"id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects.md","title":"Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射","display":"Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects","aliases":["14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects"],"display":"Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:A_0\\hookrightarrow E\">\\(a:A_0\\hookrightarrow E\\)</span> 为任一代表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:E&#39;\\to E\">\\(u:E&#39;\\to E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_E(A):=[f^*(a)]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E),\\qquad f_{E&#39;}\\circ u^{-1}=(f^*u)^{-1}\\circ f_E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_E(A):=[f^*(a)]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E),\\qquad f_{E&#39;}\\circ u^{-1}=(f^*u)^{-1}\\circ f_E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.6，印刷 pp.494–495。逆像保单射且保拉回，故不依赖代表并满足所写自然性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"a:A_0\\hookrightarrow E","display":false},{"tex":"u:E'\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"f_E(A):=[f^*(a)]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E),\\qquad f_{E'}\\circ u^{-1}=(f^*u)^{-1}\\circ f_E.","display":true}],"bytes":939,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects|Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]"},{"id":"db72d6d752e21e20","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f_E$ 见 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]，子对象逆像见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)$ 为候选单调函数。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects|Definition — 几何逆像诱导的子对象映射]]"},{"id":"f2895e14ad640cde","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c$ 是满足各坐标方程 $\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)$ 的唯一有限积比较箭头；空上下文时为到指定终对象的唯一箭头。它由 $f^*$ 保有限极限而可逆。$f^*$ 在子对象上的作用特指 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]] 的 $f_{M_{\\vec x}}$，$c^{-1}$ 在本条表示 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像。"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","d3923e299ec2ec5a"]}